    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48096</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150401</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ごほっ……ごふっ……
てめぇ、どういうつもりだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cough... cough... What the hell do you think you’re doing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150402</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ……っ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48632</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150403</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どういうつもりか答えろッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I asked you a question!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48800</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150404</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こう見えても……
泳ぎは得意なのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As you see, situations involving drowning are my forte.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150405</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ざけんな！　なぜ、お前を
見捨てた俺を……お前を殺そうと
したこいつまで助けるんだッ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The hell! Why would you save someone who abandoned you... and someone who tried to kill you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49112</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150406</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………わたくしは
もう誰も死なせたくないのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I just don’t want anyone else to die.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49240</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150407</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はっ、星をまるごと滅ぼしたんだ。
もう何人死のうが同じじゃねぇか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh, says the one who destroyed an entire planet. What’s one more life on your plate, anyways?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150408</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>同じじゃないッ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It’s not a matter of “just one person”!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150409</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>人間は、ひとりとして
同じ人なんていない……誰もが
かけがえのない存在なのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No two people are the same... one’s life cannot simply be replaced by another’s.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150410</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へぇ、カッコいいセリフだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph, those are some tough words you got there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49744</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150411</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ガルデニアに同化し
人のスピリアの味を知った
わたくしには、わかります</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know well as one who witnessed Gardenia absorbing people’s Spirias first-hand.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49872</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150412</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……だ、だったら
なぜ&lt;Kohaku&gt;を巻きこむ？
なぜ母さんの人生を奪ったんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...T-then why did you get Kohaku wrapped up in this? Why did Mom have to lose her life for this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49872</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150413</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なぜふたつの星の人間を
犠牲にして、お前だけ、
のうのうと生き続けてんだよッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why must you sacrifice people from both worlds, while you get to live carefree as you are?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150414</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたくしが死ねば
ガルデニアの封印が解け
みんな死んでしまうからですっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Should I die, the seal holding Gardenia would break, and everyone would perish as a result!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150415</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……自分が
何億回殺されても償えないほどの
罪を犯したのはわかっています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I know the sin I bear would not redeem me should I die a thousand deaths.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50524</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150416</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いっそ、この方がわたくしを
バラバラにしてくれたなら
どんなに楽になれるか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder how much relief I would feel if this man were to beat me bloody...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50708</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150417</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>感謝でもしろって言うのか!?
結局、封印は解けちまった
じゃねぇか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What, you want me to applaud to that? And besides, the seal’s already broken, isn’t it?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150418</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいえ。ガルデニアは
まだ完全には覚醒していません。
今ならまだ間に合う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, Gardenia still remains inactive. There’s still time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150419</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;、わたくしが
憎いなら、あの『黒い月』に
連れて行ってください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hisui, if you hate me so, please bring me to that “Ebony Moon”!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150420</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そこで、わたくしは……
この命とスピリアを生けにえにして
ガルデニアを消滅させます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There, I will... sacrifice my life and Spiria in order to seal off Gardenia for good.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150421</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>生けにえだと……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sacrifice...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51600</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150422</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい、そのための思念術を
二千年かかって、わたくしの
スピリアに組みこみました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, for this purpose I have set up my Spiria to hold on for two-thousand years with the use of Will Artes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51808</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150423</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>最後のチャンスなのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is my last chance.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51808</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150424</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>眠っていた体は幼いままですが
わたくしのスピリアの寿命は
もうほとんど残っていない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>While my body has remained young during my slumber, my Spiria remains hanging on only by a thread.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51808</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150425</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ガルデニアが発動する前に……
わたくしの命が尽きる前に……
どうかわたくしを、あの場所へ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Before Gardenia becomes active again... before my life burns out... please, bring me there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150426</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかった。
俺が連れていってやるぜ！
お前の覚悟を見届けるためにな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Fine. I’ll bring you there, so I can see this dedication of yours for myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150427</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい。
よろしくお願いいたします</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you, I appreciate your cooperation.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52388</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150428</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んじゃ、まずは&lt;Ines&gt;との
合流をどうするか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now, let’s see how we can join up with Ines again...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150429</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あれは
わたくしたちを捜しに来た
&lt;Ines&gt;の船では？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn’t that the boat that Ines was in when she was searching for us?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150430</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……確かにそれっぽいな。
俺たちがここにいると知らせよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Looks like it. Let’s get her attention, shall we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150431</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あの……
まさかソーマで撃つ気ですか
危ないですわよ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-um... Surely you don’t intend to fire off your Soma, that’s dangerous! </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53572</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S150432</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>心配すんな！
俺に…………まかせろッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don’t worry! Just leave this... to me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
